    p("58:9","gathered-relative",[("toplan",19),("acağ",17),("ınız",19)],"Alladhi ilayhi tuhsharuna qualifies God by the future gathering to Him. Expose the relative nominal; the future reading follows the eschatological gathering context, not alladhi alone.")
