    p("58:15","past-action-relative",[("yapmakta ",10),("oldukları",9)],"Kanu yamaluna describes their past conduct within ma's nominal content. Turkish yapmakta oldukları restores past/action-relative support rather than a context-only present yapıyorlar.")
