    d("58:22:24","Restore the heart-writing relation in the selected Turkish verb frame.")
    d("59:3:2 59:6:10 60:6:8 60:7:3","Individually retain the selected frames: an is absorbed by the counterfactual participle/conditional, min khaylin supplies the uninflected horse class under negation, kana supports the nominal hope/desire relative, and an under asa introduces a finite hoped-for event. No extra literal source case, copula or nominalizer is required in those respective constructions.",True)
