    p("60:13","completed-despair",[("umudu kes",11),("miş",10),("lerdir",11)],"Qad yaisu describes completed giving up of hope. Expose completion at qad and a coherent plural finite predicate instead of a context-only copied relative umudu kesmiş olan.")
