    d("61:10:6 62:9:7","Individually retain the selected frames: Turkish göstermek introduces the transaction as a direct object, and Cuma günü is a bare temporal expression under the prayer call. Ala/min need not be translated as literal on/from in those contexts.",True)
    d("63:10:2 63:10:3 63:10:4","Retain the inspected size verdiğimiz rızıktan shared expression: min supplies source case, ma nominal-relative content and razaqnakum the addressed provision predicate. Each foreground is already correctly exposed with no missing or extra translation key.",True)
    p("64:7","no-resurrection-claim",[("asla ",5),("diriltil",6),("me",5),("yecek",4),("lerini",6)],"An lan yubathu supplies the disbelievers' thought-content that they will never be raised. Expose passive raising, negation and nominalization; future scope belongs to lan and the clause, not an alone.")
