    p("107:2","repulsing-relative",[("itip kak",3),("an",2),("dır",0)],"Alladhi yad uu identifies the one repulsing the orphan. Restore the relative ending instead of duplicating finite iter kakar; the copular suffix is shared Turkish nominal-predicate support.")
